  "prefLabel": "Plc 2003.01 Eligibility for Initial Certification as a CHW",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2003.01 Eligibility for Initial Certification as a CHW. Any individual not currently certified as a CHW in New Hampshire who wishes to be voluntary certified as a CHW shall:\n\n(a) Have obtained a high school diploma or have passed a test that resulted in the receipt of a certificate of high school equivalency; and\n\n(b) Have achieved the skills and abilities necessary for the profession by either:\n\n(1) The work experience pathway described in Plc 2003.02; or\n\n(2) The training pathway described in Plc 2003.03.\n\nSource. #14217, INTERIM, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14388, eff 10-24-25, EXPIRES: 10-24-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc2000.html"
